{"char_end": 528, "char_start": 149, "citation_keys": ["lin2022etbert", "meng2023netgpt", "sugar2025debunking"], "claim": "C0001", "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:45:49.490246Z", "file": "main.tex", "line_end": 8, "line_start": 8, "provenance": {"actor": "human", "note": null, "run_id": null, "source": "human", "template_version": null, "workflow": "manuscript"}, "schema_version": 1, "sentence": "Among the systems examined here, tokenisation is not a shared substrate: ET-BERT tokenises raw datagram bytes with a bi-gram vocabulary, NetGPT serialises bytes to hexadecimal and applies WordPiece, and Pcap-Encoder tokenises parsed protocol header fields, so no two of these systems produce interchangeable representations.", "sentence_fingerprint": "sha256:b25e6f97bbe29e4020cb0606530d1a0aa59d8c443e7c5d0ee01a1f66bffb6ae8", "stale": "fresh", "status": "valid", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:45:49.490250Z"}
{"char_end": 825, "char_start": 530, "citation_keys": ["lin2022etbert", "meng2023netgpt", "rapier2024lowquality", "llmnids2025survey"], "claim": "C0002", "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:45:55.364463Z", "file": "main.tex", "line_end": 10, "line_start": 10, "provenance": {"actor": "human", "note": null, "run_id": null, "source": "human", "template_version": null, "workflow": "manuscript"}, "schema_version": 1, "sentence": "Every system in this corpus records, in its own text, a limit on how far its representation is expected to generalise, whether to unseen encryption, to evolving malware, or to the biases of the underlying language model.", "sentence_fingerprint": "sha256:9ecfdf7733df0bc5c616f40e8c22d425eb8cef5750ebc9f5b970aec2bfdb9162", "stale": "fresh", "status": "valid", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:45:55.364466Z"}
{"char_end": 1015, "char_start": 827, "citation_keys": ["lin2022etbert", "meng2023netgpt"], "claim": "C0003", "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:46:00.744068Z", "file": "main.tex", "line_end": 12, "line_start": 12, "provenance": {"actor": "human", "note": null, "run_id": null, "source": "human", "template_version": null, "workflow": "manuscript"}, "schema_version": 1, "sentence": "All transformer-based traffic classifiers are evaluated on ageing public benchmarks of the ISCX/USTC/CIC-IDS family, and none of them collects new data.", "sentence_fingerprint": "sha256:79b357bd4afae5cca9bf3e623abfbe61c16f76c95f834d9b2c4d16b2e331fc37", "stale": "fresh", "status": "valid", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:46:00.744071Z"}
